<p><em>Hopefully that is everyone!</em></p>
<p>I started this monster back in 2016 with the idea of making a &quot;Goofy&quot; object that actually causes a ton of chaos with a minor sliver of horror. It kinda snowballed into this crazy thing you see now. I hope it's a fun read! It was definitely fun to write (even if it took forever.)</p>
<p>The top photo is a photoshop by me that is made up of these two images:<br />
<a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Steel_donga.JPG">Image 1</a> - <em>Public Domain</em><br />
